      'filter.cutoff': 'Where the tick sits. Low is a wooden box, high is a rimshot.',
      'filter.contour': 'The upward flick at the start. Take it to 0 and the tick goes flat and dull.',
      'aenv.decay': 'Length. Past about 2 it stops being a tick and becomes a short shaker.',
